<title>USA: TVX Gold stake cut by Caisse de Depot.</title>
<headline>TVX Gold stake cut by Caisse de Depot.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caisse de depot et placement du Quebec said Tuesday it has reduced its stake in TVX Gold Inc's outstanding common shares to 4.11 percent or 6,558,691 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the investor said it sold 1.4 million shares between June 5 and July 3 at C$7.02 to C$8.85 a share.</p>
</text>
